{{~##
Primary Links Partial (revela.website)

Flat list of the site's top-level destinations, in navigation order:
top-level pages (Docs, Showcase) plus the pages inside top-level
containers without a page of their own (Pages -> FAQ, About, Downloads).
Used by the header (desktop) and the overlay menu (first block).

Expects: nav_items
##~}}
{{~ for primary_item in nav_items ~}}
{{~ primary_link = page_url(primary_item) ~}}
{{~ if primary_link ~}}
<a href="{{ html_escape primary_link }}"{{ if primary_item.current }} aria-current="page"{{ end }}>{{ html_escape primary_item.text }}</a>
{{~ else ~}}
{{~ for primary_child in primary_item.children ~}}
{{~ primary_child_link = page_url(primary_child) ~}}
{{~ if primary_child_link ~}}
<a href="{{ html_escape primary_child_link }}"{{ if primary_child.current }} aria-current="page"{{ end }}>{{ html_escape primary_child.text }}</a>
{{~ end ~}}
{{~ end ~}}
{{~ end ~}}
{{~ end ~}}
